### =============================================
### Todo App — API Test File
### Compatible with: IntelliJ HTTP Client, VS Code REST Client
### =============================================
### Usage:
###   - IntelliJ: Open this file → click "Run" next to each request
###   - VS Code: Install "REST Client" extension → click "Send Request"
###
### Set your base URL below:
###   - Local:   http://localhost:8080
###   - Railway: https://your-app.railway.app

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### =============================================
### 1. Health Check
### =============================================

### GET /health — Check app + DB connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### =============================================
### 2. Home / List Todos
### =============================================

### GET / — Load home page (all todos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

###

### GET /?filter=active — Filter only active todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/?filter=active
Accept: text/html

###

### GET /?filter=completed — Filter only completed todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/?filter=completed
Accept: text/html

###

### GET /?priority=HIGH — Filter by HIGH priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/?priority=HIGH
Accept: text/html

###

### GET /?priority=MEDIUM — Filter by MEDIUM priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/?priority=MEDIUM
Accept: text/html

###

### GET /?priority=LOW — Filter by LOW priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/?priority=LOW
Accept: text/html

###

### =============================================
### 3. Create Todo
### =============================================

### POST /todos — Create a simple todo (title only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Buy groceries

###

### POST /todos — Create with HIGH priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Fix critical bug&priority=HIGH

###

### POST /todos — Create with due date (MEDIUM priority)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Submit report&priority=MEDIUM&dueDate=2026-12-31

###

### POST /todos — Create with LOW priority and past due date (should show red)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Overdue task&priority=LOW&dueDate=2020-01-01

###

### POST /todos — Error: missing title (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=

###

### POST /todos — Error: invalid dueDate format (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Test invalid date&dueDate=not-a-date

###

### =============================================
### 4. Toggle Todo Completion
### Replace {id} with an actual todo ID from the DB
### =============================================

### PATCH /todos/{id}/toggle — Toggle completion status
# @name toggleTodo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/1/toggle
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

###

### =============================================
### 5. Delete Todo
### Replace {id} with an actual todo ID from the DB
### =============================================

### DELETE /todos/{id} — Delete a todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/1

###

### =============================================
### 6. Error Cases
### =============================================

### GET /non-existent-page — Should return 404 via GlobalExceptionHandler (not Whitelabel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/this-route-does-not-exist
Accept: text/html

###

### PATCH /todos/999999/toggle — Non-existent todo ID (expect 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/999999/toggle

###

### DELETE /todos/999999 — Non-existent todo ID (silent 200 OK — deleteById doesn't throw)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/999999

###
